# Television design tokens

Use the `.tv` variables: `--bg-primary`, `--bg-secondary`, `--surface`, `--surface-raised`, `--text-primary`, `--text-secondary`, `--accent-primary`, `--accent-warm`, `--border-subtle`, `--success`, `--warning`, `--danger`.

- Inter for text. Manrope for display lines.
- Keep type large enough for a 1920×1080 screen. Hero text stays between 48px and 72px.
- Pad the screen for overscan with `clamp`.
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.

```css
.tv { background: var(--bg-primary); color: var(--text-primary); }
```

Do not paint settings pages with this palette. Do not add neon or a decorative gradient.
